'''Ackey''' (デビルカツヤ, ''Debiru Katsuya'', '''Devil Katsuya''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Tackey]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]].

